# Build context for apps/web/Dockerfile, which runs from the repository root.
# The frozen root-workspace install needs the root manifests and EVERY
# workspace package.json, so other apps are excluded file by file with their
# manifests re-included. Use `dir/**` (not bare `dir`) for anything that needs
# a re-include: Docker cannot re-include a path under an excluded directory.

# Git / CI / agent tooling
.git
.gitignore
.github
**/.claude
**/.cursor
**/.zed
**/.vscode
**/.remember

# Dependencies and build output: reinstalled / rebuilt inside the image
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.next-*
**/.expo
**/dist
**/out
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Secrets and local data: never bake these into an image
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.data
**/.venv
**/.tools
**/*.db
**/*.db-journal
**/*.db-wal

# Repository material the web image does not use
Archive
docs
tasks
apps/research-sites

# Other workspaces: manifests only
apps/mobile/**
!apps/mobile/package.json
apps/quasar/**
!apps/quasar/package.json
!apps/quasar/packages/*/package.json
!apps/quasar/apps/*/package.json
apps/website-app/**
!apps/website-app/package.json
!apps/website-app/packages/*/package.json
!apps/website-app/mlai-website-agent/package.json

# apps/web scratch and non-source outputs
apps/web/output
apps/web/ds-bundle
apps/web/.ds-sync
apps/web/.design-sync
